<file path="README.md">
# CertPath AI

AI-powered certification exam prep platform. Study smarter with AI-generated questions, smart content, and an exam coach — free forever.

## Supported Certifications

| Cert | Full Name | Issuer | Questions | Duration | Status |
|------|-----------|--------|-----------|----------|--------|
| CCXP | Certified Customer Experience Professional | CXPA | 100 | 180 min | ✅ Live |
| PMP | Project Management Professional | PMI | 180 | 230 min | ✅ Live |
| AWS CCP | AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner | Amazon Web Services | 65 | 90 min | ✅ Live |
| PSM I | Professional Scrum Master I | Scrum.org | 80 | 60 min | ✅ Live |
| ITIL 4 | ITIL 4 Foundation | Axelos / PeopleCert | 40 | 60 min | ✅ Live |
| CSPO | Certified Scrum Product Owner | Scrum Alliance | — | — | 🔜 Soon |
| AWS SAA | AWS Solutions Architect Associate | Amazon Web Services | 65 | 130 min | 🔜 Soon |
| SHRM-CP | SHRM Certified Professional | SHRM | 134 | 235 min | 🔜 Soon |

## Features

- **AI Study Guide** — Domain snapshots, key concepts, and quick quizzes generated by Llama 3.3 70B
- **Practice Exams** — Full, mini, and domain-drill modes with cert-accurate question weights
- **AI Tutor** — Chat with a cert-specific exam coach anytime
- **Progress Tracking** — Per-cert domain progress with readiness scores
- **Exam History** — Scoped per certification with domain breakdowns
- **Question Bank** — Save and retake generated question sets instantly

## Tech Stack

React · TypeScript · Vite · Tailwind CSS · Zustand
Groq API (Llama 3.3 70B) · Cloudflare Workers
GitHub Pages · GitHub Actions · GitHub OAuth

## Live Demo

https://ammar-mufti.github.io/certpath-ai

## Local Development

```bash
npm install
cp .env.local.example .env.local  # add your env vars
npm run dev
```

Required env vars:
```
VITE_WORKER_URL=https://your-worker.workers.dev
VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=your-github-oauth-app-id
```

## Deployment

Pushes to `main` automatically deploy to GitHub Pages via GitHub Actions.

Worker deployment:
```bash
cd worker
npx wrangler deploy
```

---

Built with Claude · Deployed on GitHub Pages · Contact: muftiammar52@gmail.com
